  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of TVET in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to TVET. The main objectives are to enhance the provision of TVET in Mozambique, by upgrading TVET institutions and their staff to certification required by a new national TVET reform.</narrative>
  </description>
